  "heads": [
    "H1: your brand has a signal. we find it.",
    "P: Strategy, identity and content for brands that would rather lead with signal than noise.",
    "H3: In a world full of noise, we help brands find their signal. Through strategy, storytelling and design, we build brands that connect and resonate.",
    "P: About Us",
    "P: About Us",
    "H2: thefeedisfullofnoise.",
    "P: Everyone's posting. Hardly anyone's saying anything. So first, we tune in: to your brand, your audience and everything drowning them out.",
    "H2: selected work",
    "P: See all work",
    "P: See all work",
    "H2: what we do",
    "H3: brand strategy",
    "P: Clarity before creativity. We work out what your brand stands for, who it's for, and what it should say.",
    "H3: brand identity",
    "P: A visual system with a point of view, built to stay recognisable everywhere your brand shows up.",
    "H3: creative direction",
    "P: Big ideas, properly made. We concept, script and shoot work that looks like your brand and nobody else's.",
    "H3: content",
    "P: Words, pictures and video that earn their place, from a single caption to a full website.",
    "H3: illustration",
    "P: Drawn by hand, made for your brand. Artwork and characters that give you a look no stock library can.",
    "H3: social media",
    "P: We build and run your social presence so your brand shows up with one clear voice, every single day.",
    "H2: what we bring",
    "H2: why signalroom?",
    "H3: founder led",
    "P: You work directly with the two people who built the studio. No hand-offs, no juniors in the dark.",
    "H3: one clear signal",
    "P: Brand, design, content and copy made together, so everything pulls in the same direction.",
    "H3: less noise",
    "P: We would rather say less and mean it than add more just to fill space.",
    "H3: made in mumbai",
    "P: Built in the loudest city we know, for brands that want to cut through it.",
    "H2: don't take our word for it",
    "H2: let's build a brand people remember.",
    "P: From strategy to storytelling, Signalroom shapes brands that stand out and stay felt."
